This works for everything except the browser. For that, use:<p>```bash
.&#x2F;skift.sh run --release vaev-browser -- &lt;url-or-file&gt;
```<p>The HTTP stack is super barebones, so it only supports `http:&#x2F;&#x2F;` (no HTTPS). It works with my site, but results may vary elsewhere.<p>Most of my time so far has gone into the styling and layout engine rather than networking.
